Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Security|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: No Guest Role From WCD Article History URL
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And these variables
		|url|${portalURL}/web/guest/home?&p_p_id=com_liferay_journal_web_portlet_JournalPortlet&p_p_lifecycle=0&p_p_state=maximized&p_p_mode=view&_com_liferay_journal_web_portlet_JournalPortlet_struts_action=%2Fjournal%2Fview_article_history&_com_liferay_journal_web_portlet_JournalPortlet_groupId=10180&_com_liferay_journal_web_portlet_JournalPortlet_articleId=|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Web Content Display Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And WebContent add PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
		|portletOption|Edit Web Content|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#DIALOG'
	And these variables
		|articleID||
	And User logout PG
	And Open at locator '${url}${articleID}'
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not have the roles required to access this portlet.' at locator 'Message#ERROR'
Scenario: Validate Bean Identifier User Permissions
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And these variables
		|url|${portalURL}/c/portal/json_service?serviceClassName=com.liferay.portal.service.AccountServiceUtil&serviceMethodName=getBeanIdentifier&p_auth=|
	And Api goto P Auth URL
	And Pause at locator '1000'
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'JSONWS#SECURITY_TEST_PAGE_POPULATED'
Scenario: Validate Cannot Steal Admin Account
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SecurityTestingUsecase#ValidateCannotStealAdminAccount|
	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Api goto P Auth URL
		|url|${portalURL}/api/jsonws/user/update-status/user-id/20250/status/6?p_auth=|
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'must have DELETE permission for com.liferay.portal.kernel.model.User' at locator 'JSONWS#SECURITY_TEST_PAGE_BODY'
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'com.liferay.portal.kernel.security.auth.PrincipalException$MustHavePermission' at locator 'JSONWS#SECURITY_TEST_PAGE_BODY'
	Then AssertConsoleTextPresent the value 'must have DELETE permission for com.liferay.portal.kernel.model.User'
Scenario: Validate Forward URLPG
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|virtual.hosts.valid.hosts=localhost,127.0.0.1,${ip.address}|
	When these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And Open at locator '${portalURL}/html/common/forward_jsp.jsp?FORWARD_URL=http://www.msn.com'
	And Pause at locator '3000'
	And these variables
		|key_pageName|Welcome|
	And AssertElementPresent the value 'Welcome' at locator 'Home#PAGE'
	And AssertTextEquals assert Text the value 'Hello World' at locator 'HelloWorld#PORTLET_TITLE'
	And AssertElementPresent the value 'Welcome to Liferay Portal' at locator 'HelloWorld#PORTLET_CONTENT'
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test|
	And Open at locator '${portalURL}/html/common/forward_jsp.jsp?FORWARD_URL=${portalURL}/web/guest/test'
	And these variables
		|key_pageName|Test|
	Then AssertElementPresent the value 'Test' at locator 'Home#PAGE'
Scenario: View Update User Via JSONWS
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SecurityTestingUsecase#ViewUpdateUserViaJSONWS|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration execute Server Resources Actions
		|actionsDescription|Reindex all search indexes.|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And these variables
		|key_userScreenName|test|
	And AssertClick the value 'test' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizations#USER_TABLE_SCREEN_NAME'
	And Pause at locator '5000'
	And these variables
		|userId||
	And Api api Jsonws User View
	And Api edit Jsonws User View
		|userBirthdayDay|24|
		|userBirthdayMonth|10|
		|userBirthdayYear|1984|
		|userEmailAddress|test1@liferay.com|
		|userFacebookId|0|
		|userFirstName|test1|
		|userId|${userId}|
		|userLastName|test1|
		|userPrefixId|0|
		|userScreenName|test1|
		|userSuffixId|0|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And these variables
		|key_userScreenName|test1|
	And AssertClick the value 'test1' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizations#USER_TABLE_SCREEN_NAME'
	And AssertValue the value '${userId}' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsEditUser#DETAILS_USER_ID_FIELD'
	And AssertValue the value 'test1' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsEditUser#DETAILS_FIRST_NAME_FIELD'
	And AssertValue the value 'test1' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsEditUser#DETAILS_LAST_NAME_FIELD'
	And AssertValue the value 'test1@liferay.com' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsEditUser#DETAILS_EMAIL_ADDRESS_FIELD'
	And AssertValue the value 'test1' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsEditUser#DETAILS_SCREEN_NAME_FIELD'
	Then AssertValue the value '11/24/1984' at locator 'UsersAndOrganizationsEditUser#DETAILS_BIRTHDAY_FIELD'